sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client (curl / opencode)
    participant N as nginx :11437 (TLS)
    participant UP as llama_pool (round-robin)
    participant SC as socat unix socket
    participant R as llama-server router
    participant M as model files<br/>(var/lib/llama)
    participant P as child llama-server<br/>(model X)

    C->>N: POST /v1/chat/completions (TLS 1.3, local CA)
    N->>UP: proxy_pass
    UP->>SC: pick a healthy router socket (round-robin)
    SC->>R: TCP :8080
    R->>R: route by "model" field
    alt model X not loaded
        R->>M: read GGUF, spawn child
        M-->>R: model X loaded
    end
    R->>P: proxy to child
    P-->>R: SSE stream
    R-->>SC: stream
    SC-->>UP: stream
    UP-->>N: stream
    N-->>C: SSE stream (proxy_buffering off)
